WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.899
Welcome to Orbit. People in my life. Our focus is have / has.

2
00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:13.038
Use have with I, you, we and they. Use has with he, she and it.

3
00:00:13.038 --> 00:00:15.277
We do not have a dog.

4
00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:17.586
Does Max have a brother?

5
00:00:17.586 --> 00:00:19.920
Leo has one sister.

6
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:29.318
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
